  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "c-epitaph-yuanzhan-excerpts:p001",
      "text": "魏故使持節假黃鉞侍中太傅大司馬尚書令定州刺史廣陽文獻王銘。",
      "text_layer": "received_chapter",
      "annotation_status": "in_progress",
      "mentions": [
        {
          "id": "c-epitaph-yuanzhan-excerpts:p001:m0022",
          "start": 22,
          "end": 27,
          "surface": "廣陽文獻王",
          "kind": "person",
          "person_id": "2a3_ci1_y4y",
          "identification_status": "contextual_provisional",
          "interpretation_note": "元湛本誌題署，與其名段及王妃誌同號。"
        }
      ],
      "witness_locator": {
        "image_parts": [
          1
        ],
        "locus": "圖版000756311右葉，右起第1至第3欄。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c-epitaph-yuanzhan-excerpts:p002",
      "text": "公諱湛，字士深，河南洛陽人也。",
      "text_layer": "received_chapter",
      "annotation_status": "in_progress",
      "mentions": [
        {
          "id": "c-epitaph-yuanzhan-excerpts:p002:m0002",
          "start": 2,
          "end": 3,
          "surface": "湛",
          "kind": "person",
          "person_id": "2a3_ci1_y4y",
          "identification_status": "contextual_provisional",
          "interpretation_note": "誌主原用單名，姓據郡王身分與館藏書目補入標籤。"
        },
        {
          "id": "c-epitaph-yuanzhan-excerpts:p002:m0005",
          "start": 5,
          "end": 7,
          "surface": "士深",
          "kind": "person",
          "person_id": "2a3_ci1_y4y",
          "identification_status": "contextual_provisional",
          "interpretation_note": "誌首明書字士深。"
        }
      ],
      "witness_locator": {
        "image_parts": [
          1
        ],
        "locus": "圖版000756311左葉，最左欄。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c-epitaph-yuanzhan-excerpts:p003",
      "text": "春秋卅有五，以武定二年歲在甲子五月十四日丁酉薨於鄴。",
      "text_layer": "received_chapter",
      "annotation_status": "in_progress",
      "mentions": [],
      "witness_locator": {
        "image_parts": [
          2
        ],
        "locus": "圖版000756316右葉，右起第3欄末至第5欄。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c-epitaph-yuanzhan-excerpts:p004",
      "text": "王如故，謚曰文獻，禮也。粵以其年八月庚申葬於武城之北原。",
      "text_layer": "received_chapter",
      "annotation_status": "in_progress",
      "mentions": [],
      "witness_locator": {
        "image_parts": [
          3
        ],
        "locus": "圖版000756318右葉，右起第2欄「王如故」至第4欄「北原」。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c-epitaph-yuanzhan-excerpts:p005",
      "text": "芒阜臨北，魚山望東，安厝不異，託葬攸同。",
      "text_layer": "received_chapter",
      "annotation_status": "in_progress",
      "mentions": [],
      "witness_locator": {
        "image_parts": [
          4
        ],
        "locus": "圖版000756319左葉，右起第3欄及第4欄上端。"
      }
    }
  ],
